# Application secrets.
#
# application.properties holds shared, non-secret config and application-prod
# .properties resolves everything from environment variables, so both are safe to
# commit. The dev profile is the only file that carries real credentials, so it is
# the only one ignored — commit application-dev.properties.example instead.
src/main/resources/application-dev.properties
